### 查询货件发票信息
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/shipment-invoicing/shipments/detail
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","shipmentId":"F4385943758"}

### 提交货件发票
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/shipment-invoicing/invoices/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","shipmentId":"F4385943758","invoiceBody":{"ContentMD5Value":"base64-md5-checksum","InvoiceContent":"base64-encoded-invoice-content","MarketplaceId":"A2Q3Y263D00KWC"}}

### 查询货件发票状态
POST {{baseUrl}}/amazon/shipment-invoicing/invoices/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
tenant-id: {{adminTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"shopId":1,"countryCode":"BR","shipmentId":"F4385943758"}
